            "detailed_description": "<h1>Características</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clever Movement.</strong> Test your dexterity with a wide variety of bullet-hell challenges and platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Thinking.</strong> Put your brain to the test against a number of odd puzzles and outlandish obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt the Troof. </strong>Take potatoman through strange landscapes and a surprisingly rich story as you hunt for the troof. </p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Potatoman Seeks the Troof</strong></i> will put your reflexes and worldview to the test as you journey through scorching deserts, dark forests, busy cities, the tallest mountains and eventually your own potato-consciousness in search of the ultimate answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328500/extras/c4b8f919efb9b9135d892e385329abba.poster.avif?t=1791223166\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328500/extras/c4b8f919efb9b9135d892e385329abba.webm?t=1791223166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328500/extras/c4b8f919efb9b9135d892e385329abba.mp4?t=1791223166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precise Platforming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think just as quickly as you move, dealing with unique challenges!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your spudsy avatar in and out of obstacles paths! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your fingers to dodge rocks, eggs, and anything else thrown at you! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, run as fast as you can to find the troof!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328500/extras/4181338f593d4768f62c7a4d381c7b31.poster.avif?t=1791223166\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328500/extras/4181338f593d4768f62c7a4d381c7b31.webm?t=1791223166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328500/extras/4181338f593d4768f62c7a4d381c7b31.mp4?t=1791223166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mind-Bending Challenges!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never take anything for granted in this strange landscape!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your wits against ever-changing challenges with strange rules!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh alongside Potatoman at his bizarre and humorous journey!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for outlandish adventures and an odd sense of peace that comes with finding the troof.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328500/extras/9067dc4d879060ddd88f817a5a523f1f.poster.avif?t=1791223166\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328500/extras/9067dc4d879060ddd88f817a5a523f1f.webm?t=1791223166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328500/extras/9067dc4d879060ddd88f817a5a523f1f.mp4?t=1791223166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Potatoman on His Journey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to find the troof, little spud?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clever Movement:</strong> Test your dexterity with a wide variety of enlightening challenges and platforming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Thinking: </strong>Put your brain to the test against a number of odd puzzles and outlandish obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt the Troof: </strong>Take Potatoman through strange landscapes and a surprisingly rich story as you hunt for the troof.</p></li></ul>",
